# Everything in `assets/` is produced by the `prepare` script (`kolibri-copy-assets`):
# the KoliBri icons and favicon from `@public-ui/components`, the Font Awesome and Codicon
# sets from `@public-ui/theme-default`. Only the theme's own variant sample data is authored
# by hand and therefore tracked.
assets/*
!assets/variants/
assets/variants/*
!assets/variants/inject-variants_dyou.json

# Design source of the theme, see STYLEGUIDE.md. Kept out of the repository because the
# screens are several megabytes of PNG; they live in the design hand-off, not in git.
figma/

test-results/
